{
  "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base",
  "input": {
    "text": "我还有一套备选房，二月一日起租，月租六千四，物业二百八。",
    "language": "Chinese",
    "voice_setting": {
      "voice_id": "qwen3-profile-bb2d1428fceab540",
      "seed": 1071526420,
      "voice_profile": "男性，四十多岁，音色偏低而稳，吐字清楚但语速较快，停顿短，整体听感克制而略显不耐久候。",
      "reference_text": "我今天收到续租通知，现租约明年一月三十一日到期，通知要我十一月二十日前书面答复。我想先弄清条件再决定，应该怎么审视？",
      "reference_directory": "/ytech_m2v8_hdd/workspace/kling_mm/zhengyuanhong/read_paper/全双工/duplex-env-scaling-package/project/duplex_v2/runs/20261109-v29-user-aside-hundred-service-recovery/branches/G06-N008-R01-V01/R01-V01/audio/voices/user-reference",
